# The image builds the bundle from source; the host's node_modules is a macOS
# install that Linux cannot use, and copying it makes `pnpm install` try to
# remove it — which it refuses to do without a TTY
# (ERR_PNPM_ABORTED_REMOVE_MODULES_DIR_NO_TTY). Excluding it is both correct and
# far faster.
#
# The nested copies repeat the two heaviest of those exclusions: `target` and
# `dist` were only excluded at the repository root, so `mobile/src-tauri/target`
# and `stories/dist` still travelled with every build. Measured: a 3.5 GB context
# transfer before this line, for an image built from source on every push by
# `web-container-check`.
node_modules
**/node_modules
target
**/target
# Generated mobile build output: a measured build failed while copying
# mobile/src-tauri/gen/apple/build/arm64/Myne.ipa into the image, an artefact
# that has nothing to do with the web client being built.
**/gen/**/build
dist
**/dist
web/dist
.git
e2e/artifacts
myne-*/
